  76:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     Use Function HAL_USART_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback.
  77:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     Function HAL_USART_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
