  80:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) RxHalfCpltCallback        : Rx Half Complete Callback.
  81:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) RxCpltCallback            : Rx Complete Callback.
  82:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) TxRxCpltCallback          : Tx Rx Complete Callback.
  83:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) ErrorCallback             : Error Callback.
  84:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) AbortCpltCallback         : Abort Complete Callback.
  85:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) RxFifoFullCallback        : Rx Fifo Full Callback.
  86:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) TxFifoEmptyCallback       : Tx Fifo Empty Callback.
  87:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) MspInitCallback           : USART MspInit.
