  99:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) TxCpltCallback            : Tx Complete Callback.
 100:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) RxHalfCpltCallback        : Rx Half Complete Callback.
 101:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) RxCpltCallback            : Rx Complete Callback.
 102:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) TxRxCpltCallback          : Tx Rx Complete Callback.
 103:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) ErrorCallback             : Error Callback.
 104:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) AbortCpltCallback         : Abort Complete Callback.
 105:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) RxFifoFullCallback        : Rx Fifo Full Callback.
