 238:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to initialize the USART
 239:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****     in synchronous SPI master/slave mode.
 240:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****       (+) For the synchronous SPI mode only these parameters can be configured:
 241:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****         (++) Baud Rate
 242:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****         (++) Word Length
 243:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****         (++) Stop Bit
 244:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****         (++) Parity: If the parity is enabled, then the MSB bit of the data written
 245:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****              in the data register is transmitted but is changed by the parity bit.
 246:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****         (++) USART polarity
 247:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****         (++) USART phase
 248:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****         (++) USART LastBit
 249:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****         (++) Receiver/transmitter modes
