 745:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****   */
 746:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c **** 
 747:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c **** /**
 748:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****   * @brief  Simplex send an amount of data in blocking mode.
 749:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****   * @note   When USART parity is not enabled (PCE = 0), and Word Length is configured to 9 bits (M1
 750:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****   *         the sent data is handled as a set of u16. In this case, Size must indicate the number
 751:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_usart.c ****   *         of u16 provided through pTxData.
